	"Name": "Matching Nodes",
	"Author": "Eryk601",
	"Description": "[center][b][/b][/center][b]Matching Nodes[/b]\u00A0is a simple mod that changes textures of mining nodes such as copper, iron and gold, as well as all gem and geode ones too! It makes it so that the color of every node you find will match the colors of other rocks found in that location. For a better understanding of how the mod works check out the screenshots![left]\n<br />[img]https://i.imgur.com/31pT1qc.png[/img]\uFEFF\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]Install the latest version of\u00A0[url=https://smapi.io/]SMAPI[/url], [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url]\u00A0and\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/7517]Custom Tokens[/url].\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF\n<br />[*]Unzip the mod folder into\u00A0\uFEFF[i]Stardew Valley/Mods[/i].\n<br />[*]Run the game using SMAPI.\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[img]https://i.imgur.com/rsspQVT.png[/img]\uFEFF\n<br />\uFEFFThis mod works in custom locations added by the following mods:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/3753]Stardew Valley Expanded[/url]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5787]East Scarp[/url]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/8630]Walk to the Desert - Redux[/url]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/7286]Ridgeside Village[/url]\n<br />[*]\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/4120]Boarding House[/url]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/8587]Downtown Zuzu[/url]\uFEFF\uFEFF\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[img]https://i.imgur.com/aTU7hS5.png[/img]\uFEFF\n<br />\uFEFF[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/6976914]Vertighost[/url]\u00A0- without their help, the mod wouldn't work properly in certain areas.\uFEFF[/left]",
